    "content": "## TOOL · propose_change (Lesson 5.9)\nThe Ops Agent's only write tool. It checks the action is on the allowed list and inserts a row in crm_proposals with status proposed. It never touches HubSpot.\n\nCredentials: Postgres (Supabase).",
    "height": 220,
    "width": 480
   },
   "id": "7ce5c081-e5f8-44ad-b188-5997d6101b34",
   "name": "Note 1",
   "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
